Subject: [PATCH] cli: maximize topology viewport and name backhaul bubble

Fit at the largest uniform scale with six-pixel margins on render, resize
and completed node/client drags. Preserve node positions and defer refits
until active pointer interactions end. Display mesh_backhaul as a quoted
dark-red backhaul label without changing the SSID or topology API model.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [HWSIM evaluation WebUI]

